{"product_id":"nasty-almond-tobacco-gold-blend-salt","title":"Nasty Almond Tobacco Gold Blend Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eIndulge in the rich and earthy notes of Almond Tobacco (previously Gold Blend) by Nasty Juice! Blending rustic flue-cured tobacco with subtly-sweet honey and the savoury nuttiness of roasted almond; Nasty Juice's Almond Tobacco is a moreish combination of deep flavours. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eA smooth inhale of warm tobacco and almond floats over the taste buds, providing a flavour reminiscent of a Gold cigarette. These flavours are quickly complimented with sweet notes of syrupy honey on the exhale, perfectly rounding off this earthy blend.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLiquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFlavor: Almond Tobacco Gold Blend Salt\u003cbr\u003eFlavor Profile: Roasted almond \u0026amp; Tobacco\u003cbr\u003eNicotine Type: Nicotine Salts\u003cbr\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003cbr\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003cbr\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 35mg \/ 50mg\u003cbr\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41652564033591,"sku":"Nasty Almond Tobacco Gold Blend 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564066359,"sku":"Nasty Almond Tobacco Gold Blend 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salt-almond-tobacco-gold-30ml-min.jpg?v=1746639848","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-almond-tobacco-gold-blend-salt","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




